accTitle: Departmental SCP limits survive broader local IAM allows
accDescr: A service restriction attached to a departmental OU applies to its member-account principals. A local administrator's broad IAM allow cannot override the inherited deny.
O[Departmental OU<br/>SCP denies selected service]:::reference --> A[Member account]:::process
A --> U[Administrator role or root user]:::inputData
U --> C{Requested action matches SCP deny?}:::decision
C -->|Yes| X[Request denied]:::error
C -->|No| E[Continue normal permission evaluation]:::process
I[Local IAM allow]:::reference -.-> C
